rk3588-camera-dkms (0.1.11-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Bind rockchip,rk3588-isp-unite. The device clocks both ISP cores
    and register writes go to both windows.
  * Version above the 0.1.8 to 0.1.10 imx708 test builds.
  * Drop rk-camera-module.h, rk-video-format.h and the asm/unaligned.h
    shim. imx708.c includes none of them.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

rk3588-camera-dkms (0.1.7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Run depmod before rebuilding the initrd and reloading imx708. DKMS runs
    POST_INSTALL before its own depmod, so modprobe could not find the new
    module and dracut left it out.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0000

rk3588-camera-dkms (0.1.6-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Program a 2608-pixel line length in the 2304x1296 binned mode. It still
    wrote 7824, so the sensor ran at 39.8 fps instead of about 120.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000

rk3588-camera-dkms (0.1.5-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

